// Ch15 B01 "Unlamped" (C, 1.5 min, no dialogue). act2_ch15.md §2 B01. RULE 3: no lamp is struck at night;
// no warm source on the barge until the Hollowmere dawn. U01: the barge small on black water; Ansedra a gold
// smear going under the north horizon; the sea-glow the brightest thing in frame. U02: the empty lamp hook;
// Rhen's hand on his tinder pouch, not striking. U03: the bier under Merel's bridal cloth; a few of Tobin's
// motes still cling under its edge, held, near Liss's hand (grief anchors; nobody names it).
title: ch15_unlamped
location: ch15/open_sea
---
@letterbox on
@fade in 2.0
@camera U01
@music unlamped fade=2.0
@wait 5.0
@camera U02
@anim rhen touch tinder_pouch
@wait 3.0
@camera U03
@vfx glimmer_held at=tobin_bier count=6 rate=slow
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch15_started = true>>
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
